(UU) Rabies;
(VV) Ricin Toxicosis (toxin from Ricinis communis);
(WW) Salmonellosis caused by Salmonella enteritidis;
(XX) Salmonellosis in equine (Salmonella typhimurium, S. agona, S. anatum, etc.);
(YY) Scrapie;
(ZZ) Shigatoxin;
